{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人袁偉豪（Ben）與太太張寶兒的兩個寶貝仔「袁咕碌」和「袁氹氹」都是11月生日，大的3歲細的1歲，近日Ben與寶兒便為兩子搞生日派對，廣邀親友參與，包括陳山聰和囝囝Jaco、單文柔和囡囡小豬比、楊潮凱等，場面熱鬧。</p><p>從上載到社交平台的相片所</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:23:55.050284+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T11:01:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T11:17:13.104195+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:17:13.104195+00:00","content_hash":"adfcba47b79f6fe3ba78e595fe237ffc4525f64b67d6ae8f7d52c88e62cafc20","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}